    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Welcome to Apaertment 6, Block B, The Bottleworks, a superb two-bedroom, two-bathroom ground floor apartment ideally situated within this highly sought-after development in the heart of Ringsend. Offering bright, well-proportioned accommodation, this attractive home combines modern comfort with an exceptional city-fringe location.\r\n\r\nThe apartment features a spacious open-plan living and dining area that opens onto a private balcony, creating the perfect space for relaxing or entertaining. The contemporary kitchen is thoughtfully designed with ample storage and workspace, while the two generous double bedrooms include a spacious principal bedroom with an en-suite bathroom. A well-appointed main bathroom completes the accommodation.\r\n\r\nA standout feature of this property is the inclusion of a private storage room, providing valuable additional space, along with the convenience of secure resident parking (if applicable) and its easily accessible ground floor position.\r\n\r\nThe Bottleworks enjoys an enviable location just minutes from Grand Canal Dock, Ballsbridge, and Dublin City Centre. Residents benefit from an excellent selection of cafés, restaurants, shops, and leisure amenities, while the nearby Docklands business district including Meta and Googlr HQ makes this an ideal home. Excellent public transport links, including the DART, Dublin Bus services, and cycle routes, ensure easy access throughout the city.\r\n\r\nThis is an exceptional opportunity for first-time buyers, downsizers, or investors seeking a stylish home in one of Dublin's most vibrant and well-connected neighbourhoods. Early viewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Stylish 2-bedroom apartment\r\nSunny Balcony\r\nSecure underground parking\r\nMaster en suite\r\nPresented in walk in condition\r\nElectric storage heating\r\nManagement fees are €3367.00"
      }
    ],
